      "content": "GREAT GADDESDEN        LEIGHTON BUZZARD ROAD(A4146) TL 00 NW                                         (West side)                                         Water End 5/111                                   Barn at Grist House Farm -                                       25m to SSE of house GV                                      II Barn, now commercial premises. C17. Timber frame on red brick sill in English-bond, dark weatherboarded, with steep old red tile roofs. A tall, 5-bays, barn facing W, with central gabled projecting W porch, and opposed doorway to rear courtyard now with sliding doors. Jowled posts, mid-bay unjowled posts, mid-height rail jointed in-line, curved braces to  tie-beams,  clasped-purlin roof with one purlin to each slope, straight wind-braces, and inclined straight queen-post trusses. Listing NGR: TL0444409895"
    }
